PAGES = {'ru': ['<b>Политика конфиденциальности · 1/3</b>\nAERA VPN · Редакция от 7 октября 2026 года.\n\n<b>1. О сервисе и контактах</b>\nЭта политика описывает обработку данных в AERA VPN: на сайте aera-reserve.duckdns.org и в Telegram-боте @AERAVPN_BOT. По вопросам данных обращайтесь в поддержку @AERAVP или через команду /support в боте.\n\n<b>2. Какие данные используются</b>\nДля аккаунта используются Telegram ID, имя, username и язык, переданные Telegram. Для подписки — тариф, срок, статус, личная ссылка доступа и технические идентификаторы. Для расчётов — номер заказа, сумма, валюта, способ, статус и время оплаты, а также email, если его запрашивает форма оплаты. Сохраняются обращения поддержки, приглашения, скидки и технические события.\n\n<b>3. Для чего нужны данные</b>\nДанные нужны для входа в кабинет, предоставления и учёта подписки, подтверждения оплаты, доставки ссылки, поддержки, обработки возвратов и предотвращения злоупотреблений. Для контроля однократного пробного доступа может сохраняться криптографический отпечаток Telegram ID после удаления профиля.\n\n<a href="https://aera-reserve.duckdns.org/privacy?lang=ru">Полная политика</a> · @AERAVP', '<b>Политика конфиденциальности · 2/3</b>\nAERA VPN · Редакция от 7 октября 2026 года.\n\n<b>4. Оплата и сторонние сервисы</b>\nБанковские пароли, полный номер карты и CVV не запрашиваются и не сохраняются AERA. Их обработка происходит на стороне банка или платёжного сервиса. Telegram, выбранный платёжный сервис, хостинг и приложение Hiddify участвуют в работе сервиса в пределах своих функций. Передача данных допускается для исполнения заказа, по запросу пользователя или в предусмотренных законом случаях. У сторонних сервисов действуют собственные правила.\n\n<b>5. Cookie и техническая информация</b>\nСайт использует технические cookie для входа и защиты сессии. Email может сохраняться в браузере для повторной оплаты. Серверы могут обрабатывать IP-адрес, сведения о браузере и технические журналы для работы и защиты сервиса. В текущей версии сайта рекламные пиксели и сторонняя аналитика не подключены. Подробнее — в разделе Cookie.\n\n<b>6. Хранение и защита</b>\nДанные хранятся, пока они необходимы для подписки, поддержки, расчётов и разрешения споров; отдельные записи могут сохраняться в силу применимых требований. Доступ к администрированию ограничен, личные ссылки в базе защищены шифрованием. Абсолютная безопасность передачи через интернет не гарантируется. Удаление записи AERA не удаляет сообщения Telegram и записи сторонних сервисов.\n\n<a href="https://aera-reserve.duckdns.org/privacy?lang=ru">Полная политика</a> · @AERAVP', '<b>Политика конфиденциальности · 3/3</b>\nAERA VPN · Редакция от 7 октября 2026 года.\n\n<b>7. Обращения пользователя</b>\nЧтобы запросить сведения, исправление или удаление данных, напишите @AERAVP или в поддержку бота. Для защиты аккаунта может потребоваться подтверждение принадлежности профиля. Если отдельные записи нужно сохранить для расчётов или по применимым требованиям, поддержка сообщит об этом. Не присылайте пароли, коды входа и данные карты.\n\n<b>8. Обновления</b>\nАктуальная политика постоянно доступна по адресу /privacy и из меню бота. При изменениях публикуется новая редакция с датой. Существенные изменения, требующие отдельного согласия, не заменяются одним фактом продолжения использования.\n\n<a href="https://aera-reserve.duckdns.org/privacy?lang=ru">Полная политика</a> · @AERAVP'], 'en': ['<b>Privacy policy · 1/3</b>\nAERA VPN · Updated 7 October 2026.\n\n<b>1. Service and contact</b>\nThis policy covers AERA VPN at aera-reserve.duckdns.org and @AERAVPN_BOT. Contact @AERAVP or use /support in the bot for data questions.\n\n<b>2. Data we use</b>\nAccount records include Telegram ID, name, username and language supplied by Telegram. Subscription records include plan, expiry, status, personal access link and technical identifiers. Payment records include order ID, amount, currency, method, status, timestamps and email when requested by checkout. Support messages, referrals, discounts and technical events are also stored.\n\n<b>3. Purposes</b>\nData supports sign-in, subscription delivery and accounting, payment confirmation, link delivery, support, refunds and abuse prevention. A cryptographic fingerprint of the Telegram ID may remain after profile deletion to prevent repeated free trials.\n\n<a href="https://aera-reserve.duckdns.org/privacy?lang=en">Full privacy policy</a> · @AERAVP', '<b>Privacy policy · 2/3</b>\nAERA VPN · Updated 7 October 2026.\n\n<b>4. Payments and third parties</b>\nAERA does not request or store banking passwords, full card numbers or CVV. The bank or payment service processes them. Telegram, the selected payment service, hosting and Hiddify perform their respective functions under their own policies. Data may be shared to fulfil an order, at your request or where required by applicable law.\n\n<b>5. Browser and technical data</b>\nTechnical cookies support sign-in and session protection. Email may be saved in the browser for repeat checkout. Servers may process IP addresses, browser information and technical logs to operate and protect the service. Advertising pixels and third-party analytics are not connected in this website version. See the Cookie page.\n\n<b>6. Retention and security</b>\nRecords remain while needed for subscriptions, support, payments and disputes; some records may be retained to meet applicable requirements. Administrative access is restricted and personal links are encrypted in the database. Internet transmission cannot be guaranteed absolutely secure. Deleting AERA records does not delete Telegram messages or third-party records.\n\n<a href="https://aera-reserve.duckdns.org/privacy?lang=en">Full privacy policy</a> · @AERAVP', '<b>Privacy policy · 3/3</b>\nAERA VPN · Updated 7 October 2026.\n\n<b>7. Your requests</b>\nContact @AERAVP or bot support to request access, correction or deletion. Account ownership may need verification. Support will explain if some records must be retained for settlement or applicable requirements. Do not send passwords, login codes or card details.\n\n<b>8. Updates</b>\nThe current dated policy is always available at /privacy and from the bot menu. Material changes requiring separate consent are not accepted solely through continued use.\n\n<a href="https://aera-reserve.duckdns.org/privacy?lang=en">Full privacy policy</a> · @AERAVP'], 'zh': ['<b>Privacy policy · 1/3</b>\nAERA VPN · Updated 7 October 2026.\n\n<b>1. Service and contact</b>\nThis policy covers AERA VPN at aera-reserve.duckdns.org and @AERAVPN_BOT. Contact @AERAVP or use /support in the bot for data questions.\n\n<b>2. Data we use</b>\nAccount records include Telegram ID, name, username and language supplied by Telegram. Subscription records include plan, expiry, status, personal access link and technical identifiers. Payment records include order ID, amount, currency, method, status, timestamps and email when requested by checkout. Support messages, referrals, discounts and technical events are also stored.\n\n<b>3. Purposes</b>\nData supports sign-in, subscription delivery and accounting, payment confirmation, link delivery, support, refunds and abuse prevention. A cryptographic fingerprint of the Telegram ID may remain after profile deletion to prevent repeated free trials.\n\n<a href="https://aera-reserve.duckdns.org/privacy?lang=en">Full privacy policy</a> · @AERAVP', '<b>Privacy policy · 2/3</b>\nAERA VPN · Updated 7 October 2026.\n\n<b>4. Payments and third parties</b>\nAERA does not request or store banking passwords, full card numbers or CVV. The bank or payment service processes them. Telegram, the selected payment service, hosting and Hiddify perform their respective functions under their own policies. Data may be shared to fulfil an order, at your request or where required by applicable law.\n\n<b>5. Browser and technical data</b>\nTechnical cookies support sign-in and session protection. Email may be saved in the browser for repeat checkout. Servers may process IP addresses, browser information and technical logs to operate and protect the service. Advertising pixels and third-party analytics are not connected in this website version. See the Cookie page.\n\n<b>6. Retention and security</b>\nRecords remain while needed for subscriptions, support, payments and disputes; some records may be retained to meet applicable requirements. Administrative access is restricted and personal links are encrypted in the database. Internet transmission cannot be guaranteed absolutely secure. Deleting AERA records does not delete Telegram messages or third-party records.\n\n<a href="https://aera-reserve.duckdns.org/privacy?lang=en">Full privacy policy</a> · @AERAVP', '<b>Privacy policy · 3/3</b>\nAERA VPN · Updated 7 October 2026.\n\n<b>7. Your requests</b>\nContact @AERAVP or bot support to request access, correction or deletion. Account ownership may need verification. Support will explain if some records must be retained for settlement or applicable requirements. Do not send passwords, login codes or card details.\n\n<b>8. Updates</b>\nThe current dated policy is always available at /privacy and from the bot menu. Material changes requiring separate consent are not accepted solely through continued use.\n\n<a href="https://aera-reserve.duckdns.org/privacy?lang=en">Full privacy policy</a> · @AERAVP'], 'fa': ['<b>Privacy policy · 1/3</b>\nAERA VPN · Updated 7 October 2026.\n\n<b>1. Service and contact</b>\nThis policy covers AERA VPN at aera-reserve.duckdns.org and @AERAVPN_BOT. Contact @AERAVP or use /support in the bot for data questions.\n\n<b>2. Data we use</b>\nAccount records include Telegram ID, name, username and language supplied by Telegram. Subscription records include plan, expiry, status, personal access link and technical identifiers. Payment records include order ID, amount, currency, method, status, timestamps and email when requested by checkout. Support messages, referrals, discounts and technical events are also stored.\n\n<b>3. Purposes</b>\nData supports sign-in, subscription delivery and accounting, payment confirmation, link delivery, support, refunds and abuse prevention. A cryptographic fingerprint of the Telegram ID may remain after profile deletion to prevent repeated free trials.\n\n<a href="https://aera-reserve.duckdns.org/privacy?lang=en">Full privacy policy</a> · @AERAVP', '<b>Privacy policy · 2/3</b>\nAERA VPN · Updated 7 October 2026.\n\n<b>4. Payments and third parties</b>\nAERA does not request or store banking passwords, full card numbers or CVV. The bank or payment service processes them. Telegram, the selected payment service, hosting and Hiddify perform their respective functions under their own policies. Data may be shared to fulfil an order, at your request or where required by applicable law.\n\n<b>5. Browser and technical data</b>\nTechnical cookies support sign-in and session protection. Email may be saved in the browser for repeat checkout. Servers may process IP addresses, browser information and technical logs to operate and protect the service. Advertising pixels and third-party analytics are not connected in this website version. See the Cookie page.\n\n<b>6. Retention and security</b>\nRecords remain while needed for subscriptions, support, payments and disputes; some records may be retained to meet applicable requirements. Administrative access is restricted and personal links are encrypted in the database. Internet transmission cannot be guaranteed absolutely secure. Deleting AERA records does not delete Telegram messages or third-party records.\n\n<a href="https://aera-reserve.duckdns.org/privacy?lang=en">Full privacy policy</a> · @AERAVP', '<b>Privacy policy · 3/3</b>\nAERA VPN · Updated 7 October 2026.\n\n<b>7. Your requests</b>\nContact @AERAVP or bot support to request access, correction or deletion. Account ownership may need verification. Support will explain if some records must be retained for settlement or applicable requirements. Do not send passwords, login codes or card details.\n\n<b>8. Updates</b>\nThe current dated policy is always available at /privacy and from the bot menu. Material changes requiring separate consent are not accepted solely through continued use.\n\n<a href="https://aera-reserve.duckdns.org/privacy?lang=en">Full privacy policy</a> · @AERAVP']}

